@startuml
title Modelo de comandos da aplicação

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

class "ui::UserInterface" as UserInterface
interface "application::ICommandSink" as ICommandSink {
  + Submit(ApplicationCommand)
}
class "application::ApplicationController" as Controller {
  + Submit(ApplicationCommand)
  + ProcessPendingCommands()
}
class "application::ApplicationViewState" as ViewState <<immutable view>>
class "application::ApplicationCommand" as Command <<std::variant>>

package "Alternativas de ApplicationCommand" {
  class UpdateSimulationDraft
  class ImportTerrain
  class SetTerrainTexture
  class LoadProject
  class SaveProject
  class NewProject
  class PlaySimulation
  class PauseSimulation
  class ResetSimulation
  class RequestQuit
}

UserInterface --> ViewState : desenha
UserInterface --> ICommandSink : Submit(command)
Controller ..|> ICommandSink
Controller o-- "0..* pendentes" Command

Command ..> UpdateSimulationDraft : alternativa
Command ..> ImportTerrain : alternativa
Command ..> SetTerrainTexture : alternativa
Command ..> LoadProject : alternativa
Command ..> SaveProject : alternativa
Command ..> NewProject : alternativa
Command ..> PlaySimulation : alternativa
Command ..> PauseSimulation : alternativa
Command ..> ResetSimulation : alternativa
Command ..> RequestQuit : alternativa

note bottom of Controller
  Comandos são processados em ordem.
  Não passam pelo barramento de input.
end note

@enduml
